  "prompt": "Biểu diễn miền nghiệm của các bất phương trình sau trên mặt phẳng tọa độ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
  "choices": [],
  "correct": null,
  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Bất phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\t<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Vẽ đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> đi qua hai điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét gốc tọa độ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∉</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó, miền nghiệm của bất phương trình là nửa mặt phẳng không kể bờ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math>, chứa gốc tọa độ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> (miền không gạch chéo trên hình).</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/3b994e3825fb999069599b4985f5a31d3058a0e6f79fdafb81aa1fdeb48a785f.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div></li><li>Bất phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\t<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Vẽ đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> đi qua hai điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét gốc tọa độ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∉</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó, miền nghiệm của bất phương trình là nửa mặt phẳng không kể bờ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, chứa gốc tọa độ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> (miền không gạch chéo trên hình).</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/3324a79f0520696cb5d3a4e13a9247881de96767f6dedc83518efb7c0d02535c.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div></li></ol>",
